<h1>Connect <%= @pre_auth.client.name %>?</h1>

<p>
  <strong class="who"><%= @pre_auth.client.name %></strong> wants read-only access to
  <strong class="who"><%= current_resource_owner.workspace.name %></strong>
  as <strong class="who"><%= current_resource_owner.display_name %></strong>.
</p>

<ul>
  <li>Read incidents, timelines and postmortem status</li>
  <li>Read alerts and how they routed</li>
  <li>Read the service catalog</li>
  <li>Dry-run alert routing rules</li>
</ul>

<p>It can never change anything. Revoke access anytime under Settings &rarr; API keys.</p>

<div class="actions">
  <%= form_tag oauth_authorization_path, method: :post do %>
    <% oauth_pre_auth_fields(@pre_auth).each do |name, value| %>
      <%= hidden_field_tag name, value, id: nil %>
    <% end %>
    <button type="submit" class="authorize">Authorize</button>
  <% end %>
  <%= form_tag oauth_authorization_path, method: :delete do %>
    <% oauth_pre_auth_fields(@pre_auth).each do |name, value| %>
      <%= hidden_field_tag name, value, id: nil %>
    <% end %>
    <button type="submit" class="deny">Deny</button>
  <% end %>
</div>
